    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69828" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυλοχ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lie in a harbour</i> or <i>creek,</i> esp. <i>lie in
